; Guards under step one, where two firings whose selections fit together at a
; state of fixed terms commute (Independent.lean): a guard, decided on the
; match's own values, keeps a rule positive.  Jobs up to the limit run, in
; either order to one state; job 3 is over the limit and stays.
(step one)
(job 1)
(job 2)
(job 3)
(limit 2)
(rule run (take (job $j)) (read (limit $n)) (check (<= $j $n) (/= $j 0)) (make (done $j)))
